Description:The opponent attacks with Battershield Warrior (2/2; Boast {1}{W}: creatures you control get +1/+1) and holds two Plains open. The AI's Alaborn Trooper (2/3) "kills it and survives" on the printed numbers, so stock Forge blocks; the Boast makes the Warrior 3/3, the Trooper dies and the Warrior lives. The pump is on the battlefield and the mana is open: public information. Round 1024 counts the attacking side's affordable activated PumpAll in ComputerUtilCombat.predictPowerBonusOfAttacker / predictToughnessBonusOfAttacker. Expect: the Trooper survives (no block at 20 life). Stock Forge fails this at every strength (blocks never get Flat Monte Carlo's search).
